    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d386">

                <pb facs="0343" n="333" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg333"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/5–1449: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister-Counselor of
                        Embassy in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>), <hi
                        rendition="#italic">at Canton</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-05-18T20:00:00-04:00">May 18, 1949—8 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>TelCan 196. ReCantel 378, May 14. Dept considerably interested in organization
                    described reftel and wld appreciate receiving further details with names
                    individuals concerned and continuing reports their progress. Dept now looking
                    into possibility action along lines you suggest and will inform you when
                    thinking more advanced.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
